# error: 36:10: cannot lend `a if c else !d`: it may be `a`, a value a name holds, which lending the branching value would copy; lend each branch: `?a if c else !d`
# error: 42:9: cannot lend `o?`: it may be `o`, a value a name holds, which lending the branching value would copy; lend what it unwraps, and unwrap it in a header: `if ?o as x`
# error: 49:9: cannot lend `o ?? !d`: it may be `o`, a value a name holds, which lending the branching value would copy; lend each branch: `?o ?? !d`
